Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:23:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Stop retrying a correct refusal as if it were ungrounded

---
 scripts/run_eval.py     | 11 +++++++
 socratic/coordinator.py | 34 ++++++++++++++++++---
 socratic/tutor.py       | 67 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 3 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

diff --git a/scripts/run_eval.py b/scripts/run_eval.py
